{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Fideon canonical schema - auto (policy_check)",
  "description": "SPEC_21 section 4 canonical schema for auto, commercial (business) auto (code AU), composing common_model.json 1.1.0 by $ref: the envelope plus locations (garaging), vehicles, drivers, rating_exposures (hired auto cost of hire, non-ownership employees), rating_modifiers and countersignature. Built from the labels the line's 11 single-LOB seed documents of 5 carriers print (read in place: the business auto declarations, schedules of covered autos, Items Two to Five and the forms schedules), every field of the pre-SPEC_21 auto.json 1.5.0 (auto.crosswalk.yaml) and the line's L1 registry YAMLs. No LOB block.",
  "fideon:doc_type": "policy_check",
  "fideon:lob": "auto",
  "fideon:lob_code": "AU",
  "fideon:layout_family": "casualty_fleet",
  "fideon:schema_version": "2.0.0",
  "fideon:common_model_version": "1.1.0",
  "fideon:status": "SPEC_21 schema (10 October 2026) replacing the generated pre-SPEC_21 auto.json 1.5.0; draft for the project owner's approval. The 11 seed golds are drafted against it (DRAFT, pending reviewer sign-off).",
  "fideon:built_from": {
    "seed_golds": 11,
    "documents_read": 11,
    "carriers": [
      "Hartford Insurance Company of Illinois (The Hartford)",
      "Merchants Mutual Insurance Company",
      "National Union Fire Insurance Company of Pittsburgh, Pa. (VFIS / Glatfelter)",
      "Preferred Mutual Insurance Company",
      "Progressive Preferred Insurance Co / Progressive Specialty Insurance Co"
    ],
    "legacy_schema": "auto.json 1.5.0 (pre-SPEC_21, fideon.canonical.commercial_auto)",
    "registry_yamls": [
      "auto",
      "autob"
    ],
    "corpora": [
      "synth_core/fideon/synth_core/data/source data/<Carrier>/autob/ (11 documents, seeds)"
    ]
  },
  "fideon:blocks_used": [
    "locations",
    "vehicles",
    "drivers",
    "rating_exposures",
    "rating_modifiers",
    "countersignature"
  ],
  "fideon:lob_block": "None. Every concept the commercial auto documents print has a home in the envelope or a common-model building block (SPEC_21 4.2.4): Item Two rows are coverages[] (covered_auto_symbols, limits, premium), each scheduled auto's coverage lines are coverages[] with applies_to the vehicle, hired auto cost of hire and non-ownership employee counts are rating_exposures[]. A scheduled auto's class code, radius, size and territory factors have no Vehicle field and travel as additional_fields (section_hint the vehicle; CR-AU-03).",
  "fideon:coverage_codes_file": "auto.coverage_codes.yaml",
  "fideon:coverage_codes": [
    "X_VEHICLE_LIABILITY",
    "AU_SUPPLEMENTAL_SPOUSAL_LIABILITY",
    "X_PIP",
    "AU_ADDITIONAL_PIP",
    "AU_OPTIONAL_BASIC_ECONOMIC_LOSS",
    "AU_AGGREGATE_NO_FAULT_BENEFITS",
    "X_MED_PAY",
    "X_UM",
